Subject: [PATCH 1/5] v9 - visual redesign: library cards, focus mode,
 calculator, pomodoro
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- LibraryPage: notebook covers with template pattern preview, spine,
  recently opened strip, compact stats chips, staggered card animations,
  user avatar, gradient new button, improved empty states
- EditorPage: focus mode (⛶) collapses toolbars + panels for distraction-free writing
- Integrated smart calculator (🔢) with expression evaluator and history
- Integrated Pomodoro timer (⏱) with work/break cycles and progress bar
- Layers panel redesign: Procreate-style with color swatches and opacity bars

